e voice of the Logo Board game, in association with Smyths Toy Stores. This was a Hovis-style voiceover, and a sailor voice too! Find out more!\",\"uploadDate\":\"2011-02-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Voicing the Logo Board Game"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>A Hovis-style voiceover for this Logo Board Game commercial</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>The Logo Board Game TV Ad</h2>\r\n<p>I provided the voiceover for this Logo Board Game commercial quite a while ago, but I only just realised that I didn't write it up. When they asked me to provide the voiceover, I said yes right away. Games and toys are one of my main kinds of work now. I've voiced so many boardgames and toy ads now, such as my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/bugs-in-kitchen-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Bugs in the Kitchen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bugs in the Kitchen</a>, <a href=\"/girafun-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Girafun\">Girafun</a> and <a href=\"/pop-up-pirate-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pop up Pirate\">Pop Up Pirate</a> videos. They asked me to do my best Hovis-style voice and I think it came out well. They also asked for my sailor voice <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lNaXi0TqWXA\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Logo Board Game Ad\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">in this Logo commercial</a> and it was lots of fun to do. </p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a31u0AftQO8","title":"Voicing the Logo Board Game","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/logo-board-game-hovis-and-sailor-voice.jpg","alt":"logo-board-game-hovis-and-sailor-voice","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A little more about the Logo Board Game</h2>\r\n<p>This board game is great fun as it makes a game out of recognising logos from all the favourite brands we buy every day. The best thing about the <a href=\"https://www.drumondpark.com/logo\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"The Logo Board Game\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Logo Board Game</a> is that most of us are already very good at it, even when we're only playing it for the first time! This is because we can't help bt remember all of the brands. It's the advertising industry's fault! The game is made my Drummond Park and it has proven very successful, so I'm very pleased to have my voiceover associated with the brand. The Logo Board Game was made by the same people who made Articulate.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in Touch!</h2>\r\n<p>If you're working on something and you need a Hovis-style voiceover, or perhaps a <a href=\"/pirate-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pirate Voiceover\">pirate?</a> Please don't hesitate to <a href=\"/contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. If you need my voiceover for your next <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> or perhaps even an <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, then I'm more than happy to hear from you. And, if you need a little help working out if my voice is right for your brand, I'm very happy to provide free sample voiceovers from your script.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Voicing the Logo Board Game","pageUrl":"logo-board-game-hovis-and-sailor-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","879",{"href":"/ariel-pods-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/ariel-pods-voiceover.jpg","alt":"ariel-pods-voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Short How-to Video for Ariel Pods"}]]}],["$","$L3","473",{"href":"/apple-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/apple-voice-style.jpg","alt":"Apple Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"That Apple Style VoiceOver?"}]]}],["$","$L3","698",{"href":"/lifeless-game-trailer-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/lifeless-trailer-voice.jpg","alt":"Lifeless Game Trailer Voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Lifeless Game Trailer Voice"}]]}]]}]}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","$6","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null